msgid "I didn't hear anything."
msgstr "Ничего не слышно."

#: src/dictate-enroll.c
msgid "I couldn't listen."
msgstr "Не удалось начать слушать."

#: src/dictate-enroll.c
msgid ""
"I'll learn your voice from 4 short phrases, so I only take commands from "
